# Expected sections that conflicted on 2026-11-24

The first three cases are the Expected sections of carve#6569, #6557 and #6561 as they were first filed. The last case is the corrected Expected section of carve#6569, which the model gives.

## 6569 editorial comment across a comment line

- operation: ast
- clauses: C2-I-063 C2-I-005 C2-I-023

```crv
{#a
%% b#}
```

```json
[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"critic_comment","value":"a\n%% b"}]}]
```

## 6557 caret of a full reference after a would-be note

- operation: fmt
- clauses: C2-W-125 C2-W-088 C2-W-091 C2-W-003

```crv
^[\]
[\^][n]
```

```crv
^[\]
[^][n]
```

## 6561 reported superscript kind escapes every text opener

- operation: fmt
- clauses: C2-W-088

```crv
- ^a{\{^}^},,\{{^,,
```

```crv
- ^a{\{^}^},,{\{^,,
```

## 6569 corrected

- operation: ast
- clauses: C2-B-138

```crv
{#a
%% b#}
```

```json
[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"{"},{"type":"tag","name":"a"},{"type":"soft_break"},{"type":"comment","form":"line","value":"b#}"}]}]
```
